      "source_words_sha256": "ee02f7d338dbf783b0faa013db2eafc33e5e8cfb8c5577ae7573f39a208a04a9",
      "english": "Can't say much.\nOngoing investigation.\fNeed to question\nthat Yorozuya bastard\nabout a case.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
