      "source_words_sha256": "06b768b1a8f216d4903908821e30885de9de33f89dea8dd5473ece4be3ce7e73",
      "english": "More Gin Tama\nand more types help\nin battle. Collect your own.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
