      "source_words_sha256": "65bed86b04aaf3dee94426c6afd22474d568814614262a24a586b9d70dab052f",
      "english": "If I push it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000264C4",
      "source_words_sha256": "cb21ef4878ba2141d481fa1a1df281585f6b56bf610463ffbcdddd5f04065d3c",
      "english": "Roadwork at the end of\n[blue]North Golden St.[/color].\nCareful!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002671C",
      "source_words_sha256": "d58d0f22a167e853f8d8c8d162bacd8854cde8cf62ebfcbc763d238998593c7d",
      "english": "Move! Out of the way!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000267BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "d58d0f22a167e853f8d8c8d162bacd8854cde8cf62ebfcbc763d238998593c7d",
      "english": "Move! Out of the way!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026944",
      "source_words_sha256": "0d8945b2dc6e5f8a80417c711d0572fa41f562d11ac25eb11c2f667adbfca63a",
      "english": "Suspicious...?\fOh! Yeah, I saw one!\fI was eating dango\nat the [blue]Dango Shop[/color].\nSome weirdo kept staring.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026AEC",
      "source_words_sha256": "089d3acd86320a04d5921467f1cf291392b1df1e753ae1d79cae554f361be1bf",
      "english": "The [blue]Forest Trail[/color]...\nWhat'd he look like?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026C60",
      "source_words_sha256": "910adcbdd597e736e69dae6b431a197fc26beb9852377f37d2fc9d7d78687fd5",
      "english": "No broker. Odd guy\nby the [blue]Forest Trail[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00026D30",
      "source_words_sha256": "635f4df982d1ad6d0819cc7cb3023bb0188d7432ba4a1ce02e931c46d6bf7a5d",
      "english": "You can finally reach\n[blue]Oedo Mart[/color] and [blue]Denii's[/color]\npast the [blue]Recycle Shop[/color].\fAll this construction\neverywhere...\nWhat a nuisance.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027230",
      "source_words_sha256": "1f1d6a22d41fba227cdf67959ed4a6b06ff986de517903ddab75a3736050cce2",
      "english": "Fat, short, stupid, alien...\nPrince Hata's\na walking weak spot...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000279AC",
      "source_words_sha256": "893a65f907e0b9755ab72eac461e662b4d6fb81ca45171e36a326cc95bd91068",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027D24",
      "source_words_sha256": "2797aea05768f251dc7bd0ae5fd5941d8d6ddd003d3b8af5ab74e13911cab2e7",
      "english": "[blue]Forest Trail[/color]. Got it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027DE4",
      "source_words_sha256": "66195ebc3036682bb9aa4953461c7780dc86bb33e20d72a7e471f4c8bed654a5",
      "english": "[blue]Trail[/color] area.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027DF8",
      "source_words_sha256": "0859d1badf687313abd2dbfff2a4d9a6f26cb108f27af942c08862d90b156f92",
      "english": "Odd guy? [blue]Trail[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027FCC",
      "source_words_sha256": "a7bfb23ff96bb3df0893d7f38a6ca2de4239bfed6f397a71b57b4c1124c0f1ab",
      "english": "Yeah, you said that.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00027FE4",
      "source_words_sha256": "293801f5eaebca9a619fcdb6ed2e73b348f7c47009141fd1f95d0d2846bfb9ec",
      "english": "Odd guy? [blue]Trail[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028050",
      "source_words_sha256": "293801f5eaebca9a619fcdb6ed2e73b348f7c47009141fd1f95d0d2846bfb9ec",
      "english": "Odd guy? [blue]Trail[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028130",
      "source_words_sha256": "6278cde9ead3d2e4f863a1a895382f9419523857da09ee86c7159ba10372df9a",
      "english": "Well... I saw a really\nnervous-looking guy\non [blue]Dango Shop St.[/color]",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000281BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "90fd24fb160e07f21b0f912389a1edc5b3142c94ee60687aa45ffb3244f58982",
      "english": "The suspicious guy\nwent toward the [blue]Forest Trail[/color].\fI told the truth.\nCan I go now?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002825C",
      "source_words_sha256": "605976e913f9e1b5073d3113c104a6e0e3ef816894d8989ed743b63a9da9d8ad",
      "english": "Are you stupid?!\fThe [blue]Pond[/color]'s deep\nin the [blue]Forest Trail[/color]!\nWhy come all this way?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000282F8",
      "source_words_sha256": "da5bee3f0209abfc2b5a585d4ae7a273ed471cad25f6d5bb145e64720280567b",
      "english": "The [blue]Pond[/color]'s deep\nin the [blue]Forest Trail[/color]!\nQuit making me repeat it!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028494",
      "source_words_sha256": "f198e9a33107812760549132e24e804d4c6e216189a9fbd69501ec5ed7ddddbc",
      "english": "[blue]Dango Shop St.[/color]...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028530",
      "source_words_sha256": "a0998c4b07ba803ede799a1f8dca02f39d10ffdeba3f1c5b04c8a1f479e26a62",
      "english": "It's easy to say!\nOh, foreman...\nKnow where the [blue]Pond[/color] is?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000285C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "abdb6c2916d92909e6a4b4e4f2ed04f675d65a9a07ef122dedc1a9cfcd2c0574",
      "english": "Looking for\na Gin Tama broker.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028614",
      "source_words_sha256": "25060336c7249539af81f05302c91772a92c9dafbe8c2872ed9e4a91ed6def74",
      "english": "Seeking a Gin Tama broker.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002865C",
      "source_words_sha256": "bd2d2b6449af4345aed9151efbb6710b24927e61f49f19e0b24d10d6942f0a41",
      "english": "Someone's been\nputting up posters\nin the [blue]Public Toilet[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000286C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "7931b6153d29fcfc2342ba8f1797ea23e64bbdf257e02e4e86a7408c019650f1",
      "english": "Still looking for someone?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000286E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "1b0769dd423fa2651d3cc0e733b146f5eb808af2212f406dc45469825b17d8b7",
      "english": "Never heard of it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000288CC",
      "source_words_sha256": "0ebe7a9e329114d9476a231f7f140c1034c31b7e08e72d7d096b863ccc18c8fe",
      "english": "Hunting a Tama broker.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00028E50",
      "source_words_sha256": "6f34dd1d38641f3cc7d2ea814c6de19872d6e484a925d09a3ae2f04087348e7d",
      "english": "They used our shop...\nMama must be shocked.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002918C",
      "source_words_sha256": "d103145a4fed1bdbf1f41b070d6dce59693130da6044c319c29f84c6476fab6c",
      "english": "Hmm...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002920C",
      "source_words_sha256": "661531488131807e2b61ceb7d9b6bcd74379a520236187aa9a88756331ca727f",
      "english": "Let's give up\non the [blue]Pond[/color], Gin...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029610",
      "source_words_sha256": "726a5f77fce56590ccd666e7b9e355245d96d20be267f046b35d21fbca1546ff",
      "english": "Any [blue]Public Toilets[/color] here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029724",
      "source_words_sha256": "c8177ed3437c4bd23371ceac8bba4b6a8a90e913283676f83cd32e4521188c79",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029884",
      "source_words_sha256": "c87857c4fd52683aa153b8cccd60d364020e77ad0fc4b2e252a6814b30a846ed",
      "english": "You can drop\nthat joke now...\fKnow where the [blue]Pond[/color] is?\nTell me, please.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000299A8",
      "source_words_sha256": "9542acc44a20c5b92f43f593ceaa6579a32559672fa4753b29a1db1acd01be4e",
      "english": "Deep in the [blue]Forest Trail[/color].\fWant a ride?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000299D4",
      "source_words_sha256": "2a71cc4a17b8331d6ba1476a63669aa7c9093a9f70750aa3285a2f93c64bb6dd",
      "english": "[blue]Pond[/color] deep in the\n[blue]Trail[/color]. I can...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029A0C",
      "source_words_sha256": "62b56398e9bbb0c69c6d1c8ea8c19381e3a723d1c516c0d0d6c64f03b8eb2b6d",
      "english": "Hm? What's wrong? Lost?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029B60",
      "source_words_sha256": "0313ae29ac89756c8befa350633d06fe38863f70c26e6ed4a1c9a5e205cc06e1",
      "english": "[blue]Pond[/color] deep in the\n[blue]Trail[/color], right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029E08",
      "source_words_sha256": "0874a06691f76e181f150a7ebc17739b553873bee6ba3243d9207e9082b5016f",
      "english": "A kappa lives\nin the [blue]Pond[/color], they say.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029E90",
      "source_words_sha256": "054986049c425c23b866407e925c25abdcc734fb46343dee0109d987e15eaf42",
      "english": "Evening!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00029ED0",
      "source_words_sha256": "cabe541b0835d020514111a399dac4a0f3936d817b6c1b2a952da774fa6a256b",
      "english": "The chief's investigating.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002A298",
      "source_words_sha256": "276ebd4ffc0987fdfd711231df25be17322be35d3fcdacb19241c32df77281b9",
      "english": "Huh?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002A56C",
      "source_words_sha256": "a80b6621f24b556b29d12ba71974ca9d6c93ff225c776a2c43ecab6f0476f088",
      "english": "Nope.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002A7EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "c8177ed3437c4bd23371ceac8bba4b6a8a90e913283676f83cd32e4521188c79",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002AA34",
      "source_words_sha256": "893a65f907e0b9755ab72eac461e662b4d6fb81ca45171e36a326cc95bd91068",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002AB3C",
      "source_words_sha256": "ec8260d9e4b4f219faef0e8ba2d1700a8bb3dfa94ec55d39d0d89285ef67d88d",
      "english": "Ole! Ole!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002ABE0",
      "source_words_sha256": "4005c8edb4bf62e88d636f071fbf99dc3869720cb9c2e399709925cde6a9eac6",
      "english": "Not Gin Tama news...\fRoadwork between\nthe [blue]Forest Trail[/color] and\n[blue]Dango Shop St.[/color] is done.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002ACA0",
      "source_words_sha256": "4b0433f20279bca062cdd6aa4a442561fc24d5f03a96dc4d2a837e5bddc6ee82",
      "english": "The [blue]Pond[/color]...?\fI heard it's deep\nin the [blue]Forest Trail[/color]...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002ADBC",
      "source_words_sha256": "904c38fe2bb306c620117c72b6213122ec48209322c6883766a5f1fe810958be",
      "english": "The [blue]Recycle Shop[/color].\nGot it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002AE08",
      "source_words_sha256": "84063bf4405258cd9b66ea56f152c4c2ea1d26e0d9f249124e9d0326b2f352bc",
      "english": "I see...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002AEC4",
      "source_words_sha256": "e93ddb376f3a00653427329efa15cdfd5c2bcf01b7c830becf595b2c3bf0dde3",
      "english": "Saw him near\nthe [blue]Recycle Shop[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002AEF4",
      "source_words_sha256": "73c0719b0056cc64c445a628c36edc7ecf35ff4e9dd19e2e7a7c97e91587fe65",
      "english": "The Megumi chief?\nSaw him near\nthe [blue]Recycle Shop[/color]...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002B04C",
      "source_words_sha256": "9e18e98292b0a111c5b203e96890d4a8a68e69957701eee4ea100a349333530f",
      "english": "Why?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002B484",
      "source_words_sha256": "84063bf4405258cd9b66ea56f152c4c2ea1d26e0d9f249124e9d0326b2f352bc",
      "english": "I see...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002BF74",
      "source_words_sha256": "14326727d28da45d961f19ecfc39e69b22b49714e0b5359832f2dab17b624fbb",
      "english": "Hey, dear... Can we go home soon? I'm hungry...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002BFC4",
      "source_words_sha256": "d1b3305d8c5a70d6ef8a90013b9fc386e446499001b3ffc2e4b4be044047f5fe",
      "english": "What?! Three hits with Triple Incense?! Never seen that Gin Tama!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C014",
      "source_words_sha256": "fac44974ddd67200afd6496b6bc56ebc0895a5ccada452a0767f6832c0373b9c",
      "english": "Gwaaaah!!!\fI... lost again...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C050",
      "source_words_sha256": "7172b1dab6374c320b1db1b11f713c16c758ee9427a093e226880b22318b06cc",
      "english": "Eeeeek!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C090",
      "source_words_sha256": "a12dfb7598075de70bdaf8c8b170a2b724a286848084d2f92c72c7ad36039b0e",
      "english": "Not yet! This Gin Tama battle's just getting started!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C0C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "9c299d3f49b25027ee9d327e34d3af28294e29222734223df9104e38d56c5305",
      "english": "Take that! And that! And that!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C0E0",
      "source_words_sha256": "3fb64905f7f0087890c808ffb652ed82c1d584f5963616874a4d562d2be8b831",
      "english": "Now, another round!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C230",
      "source_words_sha256": "a11e556cb9a78de288963d2e19aeaa065dce725bb0afad5b327ef64ea8393323",
      "english": "Still can't remember?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C348",
      "source_words_sha256": "017453763a10211571c0a1449979a28f3d13a517a9cb5536c75f1bcba8589d5f",
      "english": "Which way's my house?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C430",
      "source_words_sha256": "de4eabfd28c703475f8a370e2a80200a84475c0f2440008848bdcb5f4d20174b",
      "english": "Good for you.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C444",
      "source_words_sha256": "2b96a812eaebafd289257aaee12df9d2793c931b00489ac6c2e8470e7ed71191",
      "english": "And?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C59C",
      "source_words_sha256": "c245bb086250f835238b9edc9194694ba8a9a6bd1c1c30bac4c7d021c6a376b6",
      "english": "Huh?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C5C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "6b7b403384a9d6f302ac0dc5da3b7d7024e4386307ccdbc0d3deda55a86fd2e6",
      "english": "Urk...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C650",
      "source_words_sha256": "0464ce11002822f573ac7aae61ed6d133c34b940c7d22a93e8e53b6b98763e93",
      "english": "Heh... Sounds like you're having a rough time.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C7BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "72b018e73b08a5f0dff18a7cd76bf033da0528cae89a623c85da17812f5f156d",
      "english": "Right. Learn by doing. Keep at it!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C854",
      "source_words_sha256": "533ab9534c4202040c3e896ee4e987caa594c1fdc24e07328ed7f8783d5ed854",
      "english": "What is it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C900",
      "source_words_sha256": "533ab9534c4202040c3e896ee4e987caa594c1fdc24e07328ed7f8783d5ed854",
      "english": "What is it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C910",
      "source_words_sha256": "2848fb27d8db1657e772b4152b47480492eeccc0a824e09db11ad9385ac4fc9a",
      "english": "Who's Unkei?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002C9E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "6daec3c68bbf09e775bfbcb1253c14f2d1eec3c283e459ae2d9c29fd0825e038",
      "english": "He vanished\nwhile I was napping!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CAE8",
      "source_words_sha256": "02aadc470b88462eedb7c7f30edf9e6b7dac467fccacad5f31119ea92558127d",
      "english": "Disaster!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CAF4",
      "source_words_sha256": "31f21dedb4649fed6b138cfde669428cf92add7e8e1ad03f5b67a3aaed2ad265",
      "english": "I've lost Unkei!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CB14",
      "source_words_sha256": "576ee6b6d7367749e9d57ff19a8c6dcff0dea327361a990debbc2df6369cde95",
      "english": "My brother and work partner.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CB8C",
      "source_words_sha256": "0b1ee13920ecb8e40f0d6f42f949f81b7da9def8744e5237ca9f13f55ccf9f3a",
      "english": "The roadwork between\n[blue]Dango Shop St.[/color] and\nthe [blue]Forest Trail[/color] is done.\fAll this construction\neverywhere...\nWhat a pain.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CC18",
      "source_words_sha256": "22579e8a8badb4c57a1fdc5fcafd2c07a2a55580f3939fe5b0998a968b2b27a5",
      "english": "You fought that prince, right?\fA prince must have loads of good Gin Tama. Tough fight?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CC94",
      "source_words_sha256": "1f1d6a22d41fba227cdf67959ed4a6b06ff986de517903ddab75a3736050cce2",
      "english": "Fat, short, stupid, alien...\nPrince Hata's\na walking weak spot...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CCEC",
      "source_words_sha256": "e9fd36195bbd95c131904e41e08ff6bf5077b7d34083c285d3d7e6d0febdae8c",
      "english": "That idiot prince was hanging around... Where'd he go?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CD34",
      "source_words_sha256": "ce891581d96d9495a64501aa49068116bcbd28c9158a5132a9ebbd90c27d1caa",
      "english": "Nah, easy... He's got weaknesses galore.\fFat, short, dumb, Amanto... No contest. Oh... I'm Amanto too.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CE84",
      "source_words_sha256": "60ae562abc9b536bbd261b0b4d0bc893bb2e48df1e917d5c282d5cf91922ce75",
      "english": "Oh, right! I must live long for Kanshichiro!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CF60",
      "source_words_sha256": "d68efab4ae081c17bd17532c522ec6f842b20bd08660bc3b8fc02a2d6b8e032e",
      "english": "Kanshichiro! Grow up big and strong!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002CFAC",
